{"sections":[{"slug":"切结构","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"切结构"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">切结构</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"切结构"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">切结构</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是基于光滑流形的切丛的一大类</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的统称</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">包括</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定向</span></strong>, <strong>Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span></strong>, <strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/近复结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它是流形的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/切丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">切丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛的约化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">约化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $p \\colon G\\to \\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的同态</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">这里的</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">可以是离散群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也可以是</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">甚至可以是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">依实际需要决定</span>)</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $m\\leq n$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $m$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个</span> $p$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构是</span> $TM\\oplus\\mathbb{R}^{n-m}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的分类映射</span> $M\\to \\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个提升</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccc}\r\n\t&amp;&amp; \\mathbf{B}G\\\\\r\n\t&amp;\\nearrow&amp;\\downarrow {\\scriptsize \\mathbf{B}p}\\!\\!\\!\\!\\\\\r\n\tM&amp;\\to &amp;\\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{GL}_n.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $p$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构的集合是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span> $H^1(M,G) \\to H^1(M,\\mathrm{GL}_n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">之下</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">切丛</span> $TM$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的元素的原像</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当群同态</span> $p\\colon G\\to \\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">没有歧义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">或有一个公认的选取</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">比如</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也称</span> $p$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构为</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">带</span> $p$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构流形的范畴</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分解同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的理论使用如下范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Mfd}_n$, <span lang=\"zh\">其对象为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维光滑流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">态射空间为光滑</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">嵌入</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的空间</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">注意不是光滑映射的空间</span>). <span lang=\"zh\">对于群同态</span> $p \\colon G\\to \\mathrm{GL}_n$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">带</span> $p$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形的范畴</span>” $\\mathsf{Mfd}_n^p$ <span lang=\"zh\">为如下拉回</span>.</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccc}\r\n\\mathsf{Mfd}_n^p &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathsf{Ani}_{/\\mathbf{B}G}\\\\\r\n\\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow\\\\\r\n\\mathsf{Mfd}_n &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathsf{Ani}_{/\\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{GL}_n}\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形上</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">平凡子群</span> $1\\to\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的结构即为切丛的平凡化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">标架</span></strong>.</li>\n<li>$\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{GL}_n}$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构等于没有结构</span>.</li>\n<li>$\\mathrm{GL}_n^+$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构就是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定向</span></strong>.</li>\n<li>$\\mathrm{SL}_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">体积形式</span></strong>.</li>\n<li>$\\mathrm{O}_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构相当于</span> <strong>Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span></strong>.</li>\n<li>$\\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathbb{C})\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{GL}_{2n}(\\mathbb{R})$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构就是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/近复结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>$\\mathrm{U}_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构又叫</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">近</span> Hermite <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span></strong>.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自旋群","text":"$\\mathrm{Spin}_n$"}},{"Plain":"-<span lang=\"zh\">结构称为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自旋流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自旋结构</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">正合列</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为定向</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即有一个</span> $\\mathrm{SO}_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span> $M \\to \\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{SO}_n$. <span lang=\"zh\">现在问</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是否具有</span> $\\mathrm{Spin}_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维列</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathbf{B}\\mathbb{Z}/2 \\to \\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{Spin}_n \\to \\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{SO}_n \\to \\mathbf{B}^2\\mathbb{Z}/2,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它给出</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的正合列</span>\n$$\r\nH^1(M,\\mathbb{Z}/2) \\to H^1(M,\\mathrm{Spin}_n)\\to H^1(M,\\mathrm{SO}_n) \\to H^2(M,\\mathbb{Z}/2),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">而复合映射</span> $M \\to \\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{SO}_n \\to \\mathbf{B}^2\\mathbb{Z}/2$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> $H^2(M,\\mathbb{Z}/2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素恰为第二</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Stiefel--Whitney类","text":"Stiefel–Whitney <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":" $w_2(M)$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">故</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自旋流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自旋结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">当且仅当</span> $w_2(M)=0$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">可积性</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一些重要的结构如复结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">辛结构</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler结构","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">是由</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构附加某些可积性条件得到的</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}